# The sdist carries every file under tests/, conftest.py included (its fixtures are not test_*.py),
# and the launchers, policies and adopt templates those tests execute and read (W1228, W1231). The
# privacy judge withholds home paths in policy/standing_test.rego and quoted shapes in
# policy/publish_privacy.rego; each is an accepted entry with its reason in publish_privacy.rego.
graft tests
graft bin
graft policy
graft adopt
